# 🔐 SentinelX AI Cyber Defense System

An AI-powered cybersecurity threat intelligence platform designed to analyze IP addresses, detect suspicious network behavior, visualize cyber activity, and provide interactive threat analytics using Machine Learning and real-time IP intelligence APIs.

---

# 🚀 Live Demo

https://sentinelx-ai-cyber-defense-system-mdrpjytwcmytnqwusayemw.streamlit.app/

---

# 📂 GitHub Repository

https://github.com/bhargav-62/SentinelX-AI-Cyber-Defense-System

---

# 📌 Features

✅ Public IP Address Intelligence Analysis  
✅ Geolocation Tracking using IP APIs  
✅ Organization and Timezone Detection  
✅ Interactive Cybersecurity Dashboard  
✅ Machine Learning Based Threat Detection  
✅ Isolation Forest Anomaly Detection  
✅ Simulated Network Activity Monitoring  
✅ Threat Status Identification  
✅ Interactive Analytics Charts  
✅ Live Deployment using Streamlit Cloud

---

# 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Plotly
- Requests API
- Isolation Forest Algorithm

---

# 🧠 Machine Learning Concept

The project uses the Isolation Forest Machine Learning algorithm to identify suspicious and anomalous network activities based on:

- Request Count
- Failed Login Attempts
- Data Transfer Volume

Activities identified as abnormal are classified as suspicious threats.

---

# 🌍 IP Intelligence Information

The platform fetches real-time IP information including:

- IP Address
- City
- Country
- Organization
- Approximate Location
- Timezone

using public IP intelligence APIs.

---

# 📊 Dashboard Modules

## 🔹 Security Overview
Displays:
- Threat Level
- Request Metrics
- System Status
- Number of IPs Analyzed

## 🔹 IP Intelligence
Shows detailed IP information and geolocation data.

## 🔹 Approximate IP Location
Visualizes IP location on an interactive map.

## 🔹 Network Activity Analysis
Displays:
- Requests
- Failed Logins
- Data Transfer

using interactive analytics charts.

